  "limitations": [
    "Planned additive successor; historical API012 artifact/patch/pins/native44 unchanged. Reviewed tests/red/source/artifact/ABI/load/CI gates remain.",
    "Closing a8d495e8 A1\u2013A4/A6: bound facade calls off IO0/after close; declare disposal-callback thread/Transport lifetime and terminal-registry peer context; foundation-only read_observed/throw-before-parse. Pure-helper/thread/editorial clarifications enter the owning reviewed stage; sourcecee1845 stays frozen.",
    "Tests stage is the reviewed APITEST-016 foundation baseline (PR #124), not new API-016 tests: its actual authors, revision 606b956a and receipts are copied from progress/proofs/APITEST-016.json. Paths are limited to the eight files byte-identical between 606b956a and the API-016 head; the frozen driver/probe/inventory/RESOURCE_REVIEW, first-party headers, 44 native methods, API-012 inputs and host baseline stay identical to 4e4ca67d.",
    "Implementation cycle: initial Claude review at 8fbc0ee8 requested changes (blockers I1-I10, non-blocking I11-I21, the two-comment receipt 6915778135/6915778605); fix round 1 to c9a82e50, Codex verification and Claude closing approved there (V1, C1-C6 non-blocking). After that approval: pre-merge commit 59c29305 (correction 16, V1 mutex), owner-ordered fix round 2 f8be1aec (correction 17), 0e774a51 and the owner-approved third and last author pass 98944306 (correction 18). Codex verification and fresh Claude closing re-check of everything since c9a82e50 both approved 98944306; V2 non-blocking.",
    "Three defects found only by independent measurement, not by any frozen test or earlier review: tick-paced parsing (present from the start), lost continuation with more than 8 connections (f8be1aec) and established native peers that stop reading (suspend/admit at 8fbc0ee8 and 0e774a51; more than 8 native peers at 0e774a51). Final-head measurement 6929231415 found no regression. Lasting tests are APITEST-017 (#672), planned and not authorized.",
    "Failed CI runs on the branch: 43849854281 (4f9a3259, host baseline loader), 43871964329 (603d1d34) and 43885544057 attempt 1 (59c29305), both the tick-paced split defect; attempt 2 of 43885544057 was an unauthorized re-run and is not evidence; 43875943527 (f54297e0) cancelled as superseded. Reviewed head 98944306 passed all seven required checks in run 43943376942, attempt 1.",
    "Development evidence only: synthetic loopback behind technical consumer gates, selected Linux CI. No product host, public HTTP, live provider, platform, deployment or release verification. Deferred follow-ups (C2, C4-C6, I14-I16, I19-I20, V2 stale 'corrections 1-17' in README/STATUS/TEST_STRATEGY, O5) are not solved by this record. Final proof-head CI, protected merge, read-back and closing #616 are external gates after this commit."
